Description: AILinux TriForce Multi-LLM Backend
 TriForce is a FastAPI-based multi-LLM orchestration backend supporting
 600+ AI models across 9 providers with 134+ MCP tools, RBAC, federation
 mesh, and 4-layer memory. Powers the AILinux ecosystem.
